$MDESC::Type = "CTF_HamstersMaps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Author: <f0> Hamster_of_Doom!" @
	 "\n<f1>Questions, Comments, Pity: <f0> rvr279@home.com" @
 	 "\n<f1>ICQ: <f0> 25400277 <f1>AIM: <f0> Rover v1" @	 
	 "\n<f1>Map Version: <f0> 1.3" @
	 "\n<f1>Updates: <f0> http://members.home.net/rvr279/hamster" @
	 "\n<f1>Map Type: <f0> Server-Side" @
	 "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Deus Sanguinius" @
         "\n<f1>Gravity: <f0> Normal" @ 
	 "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @        
	 "\n<f1># of Captures to Victory: <f0> 5" @
	 "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
	 "\n<f1>Max # of Players: <f0> 32" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> Listen up recruits! Since this was Hamster's first attempt at map making, let's give this map a run-around! A few things have been changed from the Broadside you remember, so stay on your toes!\n\nDISMISSED!\n\n<f1>Tips:\n<f0>The outside tower contains a vehicle pad and an inventory station in it with a separate power supply. Remember this fact if your power goes down and you need help getting it back up.\nThe inventory, command, and ammo stations on the two platforms can be used by anyone. All three are powered by the gen behind the inv station on the lower platform.\n\n<f1>Version History<f0>\nVers. 1.3\nUpdated contact info.\n\nVers. 1.2\nCreated the elevator in the center.\nAdded the outer three stations & gens and lower platform (on the hill).\nMade each teams outer base on an independent power supply.\nAdded center rocks.\nAdded rocks to make one team's outer base look like it is not hovering.\nBoth team's crow's nests now have ammo stations.\nAdded weapons & packs on top of both team's crow's nests.\n\nVers. 1.1\nUpdated (.dsc) description file.\n\n<f1>Thanks to:\n<f0>Shadow of Death and Tedaw for debuting my maps on their server!\nOmnipotent & others for their mapping tutorials.\nThe mapping community at large for inspiration, demonstration, and perspiration.\nAnd of course the team at Dynamix for Tribes!";
